Error [E0927]: `#Pure` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/E0927_retired_pure_trait_oneline.jet:3:6
    |
  3 |     #Pure fn a() -> Int
    |      ^^^^
 Why: `Pure` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: Did you mean `#Pre`?
